syn match jswTemp /\<_[A-Za-z0-9_$]\+\>/
syn keyword jswBuiltin abs acos asin atan block breakpoint ceil ceiling cos error exp float floor isCompiled isTurboWarp join len length lengthOf ln log log10 menu pow10 sin sqrt startTimer stopTimer string tan warn
syn keyword jswNamespace Clone Comments Control Events JSON Lists Looks Mem MoreEvents Motion Music Operators Pen Pointerlock Ram Runtime Sensing Sound Stage Temp Timer TurboWarp Util Variables WebSocket console microbit pen sound
